{"strongs": "H3730", "word": "כַּפְתּוֺר", "translit": "kaph.tor", "root": "כפתור", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "capital", "definition": "I. כַּפְתּוֺר כַּפְתֹּר noun masculine 1. capital , 2. knob, bulb ( 2. perhaps earlier meaning; Hoffm ZAW iii. (1883), 124 , compare Syriac pear ( Löw No. 153 ), from shape); — 1. כַּפְתּוֺר Amos 9:1 capital of pillar; so plural suffix כַּפְתֹּרֶיהָ Zeph 2:14 . 2. כַּפְתֹּר , knob or bulb, ornament on the golden lamp-stand in tabernacle; ᵐ5 σφαιρωτήρ , Jos Archaeology iii, 6, 7 ρὁΐσκος small pomegranate ; ᵑ9 . sphaerula: — Exod 25:33 (twice in verse); Exod 25:35 (3 t. in verse) = Exod 37:19 (twice in verse); Exod 37:21 (3 t. in verse); suffix כַּפְתֹּרֶיהָ Exod 25:31 ; Exod 25:34 = Exod 37:17 ; Exod 37:20 , כַּפְתֹּרֵיהֶם Exod 25:36 = Exod 37:22 (all P ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4172')\">BDB4172</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3730')\">H3730</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4171')\">BDB4171</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4173')\">BDB4173</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>כַּפְתּוֺר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>כַּפְתֹּר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlightword>capital</highlightword>, </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlightword>knob, bulb</highlightword> (</div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> perhaps earlier meaning; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hoffm')\">Hoffm<sup>ZAW iii. (1883), 124</sup></lookup>, compare Syriac <placeholder2626/> <highlight>pear</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Löw')\">Löw<sup>No. 153</sup></lookup>), from shape); — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>כַּפְתּוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 9:1\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,1)\">Amos 9:1</ref> <highlight>capital</highlight> of pillar; so plural suffix <bdbheb>כַּפְתֹּרֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zeph 2:14\" b=\"36\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(36,2,14)\">Zeph 2:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <bdbheb>כַּפְתֹּר</bdbheb>, <highlight>knob</highlight> or bulb, ornament on the golden lamp-stand in tabernacle; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>σφαιρωτήρ</grk>, Jos<sup>Archaeology iii, 6, 7</sup> <grk>ρὁΐσκος</grk> <highlight>small pomegranate</highlight>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Vg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ9</reflink></bdbheb></lookup>. <highlight>sphaerula:</highlight> — <ref ref=\"Exod 25:33\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,33)\">Exod 25:33</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Exod 25:35\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,35)\">Exod 25:35</ref> (3 t. in verse) = <ref ref=\"Exod 37:19\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,19)\">Exod 37:19</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Exod 37:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,21)\">Exod 37:21</ref> (3 t. in verse); suffix <bdbheb>כַּפְתֹּרֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 25:31\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,31)\">Exod 25:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 25:34\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,34)\">Exod 25:34</ref> = <ref ref=\"Exod 37:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,17)\">Exod 37:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 37:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,20)\">Exod 37:20</ref>, <bdbheb>כַּפְתֹּרֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 25:36\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(2,25,36)\">Exod 25:36</ref> = <ref ref=\"Exod 37:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,22)\">Exod 37:22</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </p></div><hr>", "re